6NUS_4bohs5WrdOkzsXHeH9XHPBlVZWelw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ShredST", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPbyFTdiJq", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": " @ShredST  you don't need to know everything about something to know that it's not the same as another.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC1frLRIoY3LXqqoPSnxwEAw", "author": "@CupaCozy", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/niL8pIwtciqMbUudgJhKyVT0vW6uQlu78iWi0qYOq-U6_1q-8_zBynKkUxMdCVE0Pw59gsdD_A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CupaCozy", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPkUaClzm9", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": "Ray tracing (or path tracing) produces photorealistic images, therefore it simulates how light behaves in real life. Algorithmically, ray tracing seems backwards, but the actual result is what matters.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCAvCHJ1TgS8rJcUws0n5xyA", "author": "@ShredST", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kFHR_Y06NUS_4bohs5WrdOkzsXHeH9XHPBlVZWelw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ShredST", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago (edited)", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPom79Aakq", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": "Except cause and effect are not the same thing either.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC1frLRIoY3LXqqoPSnxwEAw", "author": "@CupaCozy", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/niL8pIwtciqMbUudgJhKyVT0vW6uQlu78iWi0qYOq-U6_1q-8_zBynKkUxMdCVE0Pw59gsdD_A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CupaCozy", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPpDlbdURk", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": " @ShredST  he said \"light works like it normally would in the world\". What I'm saying is no, it doesn't. It works differently. Ray tracing simulates the effect, but uses a different, in fact an opposite cause to create that effect.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC1frLRIoY3LXqqoPSnxwEAw", "author": "@CupaCozy", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/niL8pIwtciqMbUudgJhKyVT0vW6uQlu78iWi0qYOq-U6_1q-8_zBynKkUxMdCVE0Pw59gsdD_A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CupaCozy", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPq9B7uNA6", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": "What I'm saying is who cares about the what the algorithm looks like? The end result is what ultimately determines if the algorithm actually correctly simulates the behavior of light.", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCAvCHJ1TgS8rJcUws0n5xyA", "author": "@ShredST", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kFHR_Y06NUS_4bohs5WrdOkzsXHeH9XHPBlVZWelw=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@ShredST", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg.8lOli_wFHLY8lPrhi9IEr3", "parent": "UgyDvP46M3A4tkGv42F4AaABAg", "text": " @ShredST  I do see your point. I agree that if the end result is the same, it doesn't really matter. I think I was just thrown off in the beginning by the fact that he said that \"it works\" and I immediately thought, no it doesn't. You're right though, it is a technicality and not very important", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UC1frLRIoY3LXqqoPSnxwEAw", "author": "@CupaCozy", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/niL8pIwtciqMbUudgJhKyVT0vW6uQlu78iWi0qYOq-U6_1q-8_zBynKkUxMdCVE0Pw59gsdD_A=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@CupaCozy", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyFussgthzixVZYB154AaABAg", "parent": "root", "text": "So in other words stay away from this stinker", "like_count": 3, "author_id": "UCVU4_HNBUc-0uNHaAjqWysw", "author": "@Chexmaster", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/talOZc2b9kebQ8WOs6WFUzLKitMoUOuivMhTXG6sChExoXnIlL88LSvxTfJTHEUBavxqPebcY8M=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@Chexmaster", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}, {"id": "UgyFussgthzixVZYB154AaABAg.8lOlcUR6x-w8lOrrG8IVdo", "parent": "UgyFussgthzixVZYB154AaABAg", "text": "The 2080ti versions are all sold out", "like_count": 0, "author_id": "UCr1XUcbBa9dk5FtovcDvHHA", "author": "@vezeveer", "author_thumbnail": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/1HMvDf3deiMC5c2YEY1IIkPQRjtXToDhT2w3Ie20IKBNV3MDyqqEZIoGV57T47iXQ3aJ9DGJBlo=s88-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "author_is_uploader": false, "author_is_verified": false, "author_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@vezeveer", "is_favorited": false, "_time_text": "7 years ago", "timestamp": 1541289600, "is_pinned": false}]